                Plato
              </h3>
            </div>
            <button
              type="button"
              id="nutricion-modal-close"
              class="shrink-0 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-[0.58rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-zinc-500 transition hover:bg-white/5 hover:text-white"
